rcare il regalo perfetto."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"David is an American architect who relocates across the pond to take up a job at a prestigious London firm. As the clock counts down to Christmas Day, David is running out of time to buy his girlfriend – who also happens to be his boss’s daughter – a thoughtful present so he resorts to buying her a somewhat uninspired gift card.","tagline":"One day is all it takes to change your life."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9UsEblElLtk3XkIVrI5dx70FYj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e9UsEblElLtk3XkIVrI5dx70FYj.png","language":"en","width":1801,"height":578},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ieyswsfSNtQ8cpadiy3q7YZSsM5.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ieyswsfSNtQ8cpadiy3q7YZSsM5.png","language":"en","width":782,"height":252}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kpImzOJTLJp9OVy1mWo3p8QINkf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kpImzOJTLJp9OVy1mWo3p8QINkf.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1VHeaFtWasDMN8roBazGiVmofOT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1VHeaFtWasDMN8roBazGiVmofOT.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26YADsX1ub5IhnYHIMoSAZBeRDR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/26YADsX1ub5IhnYHIMoSAZBeRDR.jpg","language":"en","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zSA3RqfvqRteRPrXNHN97wwGd2r.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zSA3RqfvqRteRPrXNHN97wwGd2r.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ka28Aq2m3Q93xxzveQJBdPnC7p6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ka28Aq2m3Q93xxzveQJBdPnC7p6.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster